	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　World of Monsters'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'Forest By Kesselring’s Castle'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Kite and Kesselring were'
	R
	'walking in the forest.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'So you’re finally moving'
	R
	'out...?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah... I don’t really have'
	R
	'any objections.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s strange...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'What is?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'You hate and kill some humans'
	R
	'with the same hands you use to'
	R
	'happily hug human children.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t you think that’s strange'
	R
	'too?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'I think you’re stranger for'
	R
	'being as respectful as you are'
	R
	'towards someone that’s only'
	R
	'been a demon as long as me.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Heh... Well...'
	R
	'That’s how I am.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Hahaha...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021b3:
	ZH 1:
	'They started walking in'
	R
	'silence again.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Now, I’ll part around here...'
	R
	'Sorry, Mr. Kesselring.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t apologize, I’m the one'
	R
	'that decided to tag along...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'...Mr. Kite.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'I think you would feel better'
	R
	'if you didn’t spend so much'
	R
	'time with humans.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'...Is that what you wanted to'
	R
	'talk about?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... It’s not very'
	R
	'demon-like behavior...'
	R
	'And humans die before we do.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'I know the pain of becoming'
	R
	'attached to such beings all'
	R
	'too well...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Mr. Kesselring...'
	R
	'I want to help those kids...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s why I became a demon to'
	R
	'begin with.'
	R
	'I know it’s foolish.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Mr. Kite...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'...Be careful.'
	R
	'You can’t even take humans'
	R
	'lightly as of late.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm... Now then...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0224d:
	\L_02223:
	ZH 1:
	'Kite parted with Kesselring'
	R
	'and walked toward the human'
	R
	'realm.'
