	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　　Zeth'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　　Green Village'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Green Village was used to'
	R
	'isolate people with an'
	R
	'incurable illness called'
	R
	'greening disease.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'It afflicted only girls from'
	R
	'10 to 19. When one catches it,'
	R
	'her whole body turns green and'
	R
	'she dies within 10 years.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'For fear of them infecting'
	R
	'others, the girls afflicted'
	R
	'with this were sent to Green'
	R
	'Village and quarantined.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s said to kill about 60'
	R
	'people throughout the whole'
	R
	'continent each year.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Green Village was built on the'
	R
	'border with the Monster Forest.'
	R
	'It’s an essentially forsaken'
	R
	'location.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Even though it had no guards'
	R
	'and could be annihilated by'
	R
	'monsters at any time.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Rather, that’s what the people'
	R
	'in the area around the village'
	R
	'wished for.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Kite came to visit the'
	R
	'dwelling that was forgotten by'
	R
	'people.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Then he entered the village'
	R
	'without any problems.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	!VAR0516 : 57!
	\L_0223f:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Kite.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Calory.'
	R
	'How are you feeling?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Right now... I...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_02223:
	ZH 1:
	'Calory’s smile was sad, yet'
	R
	'happy.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'I see...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_02223:
	ZH 1:
	'Calory was one of the girls'
	R
	'that was infected with'
	R
	'greening disease and abandoned'
	R
	'here.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'But she diligently took up the'
	R
	'burden of nursing all the'
	R
	'other girls and trying to help'
	R
	'them.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Kite was standing and facing'
	R
	'her. He took her hand and put'
	R
	'a bag of money in it.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Take it.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Again, Kite...?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t worry about it.'
	R
	'I didn’t steal it or anything.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'I know... But...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Calory.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes...?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Please take care of everyone'
	R
	'that’s suffering. I’ve got no'
	R
	'way to cure their illness,'
	R
	'this is all I can do.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'No!!'
	R
	'Giving us money is plenty on'
	R
	'its own. And this much, at'
	R
	'that...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Thank you...'
	R
	'With this, we can buy medicine'
	R
	'and other good things.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_02223:
	ZH 1:
	'Everyone knew that the miracle'
	R
	'cures on the market for'
	R
	'greening disease didn’t do'
	R
	'anything.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'But Calory, and the other'
	R
	'diseased girls as well, wanted'
	R
	'desperately to cling to'
	R
	'something no matter what.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ll be back.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Wait, please.'
	R
	'I’ll make some tea.'
	R
	'Everyone would be happy to'
	R
	'know you’re here...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'...Is that so?'
	R
	'Then...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... This way, please...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_02223:
	ZH 1:
	'Calory blushed slightly and'
	R
	'walked in front of Kite.'
