	\L_02223:
	ZH 1:
	'Calory continued crying into'
	R
	'Kite’s chest.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_02197:
	ZH 1:
	'Damn you, humans...'
	R
	'These children... My sister...'
	R
	'They didn’t catch this disease'
	R
	'because they wanted to...'
