	\L_02293:
	\L_021b3:
	ZH 1:
	'Kite showed Calory the giant'
	R
	'lump of meat in his hand.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Well... Wow!'
	R
	'This is some quality meat...'
	R
	'Thank you...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'What is it?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_02223:
	ZH 1:
	'For a moment, Calory cringed'
	R
	'and she looked uneasy.'
	R
	'It didn’t escape Kite’s notice.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Uh... Um...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Why...?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Why what?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Why do you do this for people'
	R
	'like us...?'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'We were abandoned by humans,'
	R
	'but you’re so kind to us...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Um... Kite...'
	R
	'You’re a demon, right?'
	R
	'I’d heard that demons don’t'
	R
	'associate with humans much...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'And if they do... Um... It’s'
	R
	'to kill them for fun, or...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'B-But not you!'
	R
	'You don’t seem like you would'
	R
	'do that, Kite...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'But you don’t have anything to'
	R
	'gain from being kind to us...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Is it because you feel bad for'
	R
	'us?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Calory...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes...?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Greening disease has been'
	R
	'around since I was a human.'
	R
	'Yes... 500 years ago.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021b3:
	ZH 1:
	'Kite began seriously talking'
	R
	'about himself.'
	R
	'Calory understood and quietly'
	R
	'listened to his story.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'I was 5 at the time, I think...'
	R
	'Well, this was a while ago.'
	R
	'I don’t remember exactly, but'
	R
	'I was a child.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'I had an older sister.'
	R
	'My parents were busy with work,'
	R
	'so she took care of me...'
	R
	'She was my only sister.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'She... caught greening disease.'
	R
	'As soon as she did,she was'
	R
	'sent here... to Green Village.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'I wanted to see her and'
	R
	'pestered my parents.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'But when I did, they hit me.'
	R
	'When I’d leave the house to'
	R
	'try and go see her, they’d'
	R
	'drag me back and beat me.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'That was when I became'
	R
	'determined to get stronger.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'With strength, I could stop my'
	R
	'parents from holding me back,'
	R
	'and the stronger I got the'
	R
	'more prize money I could get.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'To me, getting stronger and'
	R
	'doing kempo was a way to get'
	R
	'closer to my sister, however'
	R
	'little that was.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'I got strong.'
	R
	'Strong enough that I could'
	R
	'crush anyone that’d tell me to'
	R
	'do anything...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'It took ten years...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s when I was able to come'
	R
	'to Green Village, too.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'What I saw back then wasn’t'
	R
	'the beautiful place that’s'
	R
	'here now.'
	R
	'It was much more awful...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Due to being so close to the'
	R
	'Monster Forest, monsters'
	R
	'attacked all the time and'
	R
	'killed people...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Even if anyone managed to get'
	R
	'out and return to the city,'
	R
	'they’d be forced to come'
	R
	'back... It was terrible...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'My sister... died before I got'
	R
	'there. I don’t even know how'
	R
	'she died.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'They only told me that the'
	R
	'girl I described wasn’t around'
	R
	'anymore.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'I lost my sister...'
	R
	'It came as a great shock, but'
	R
	'I couldn’t let myself die then.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Some good that came out of'
	R
	'this, I guess you could say,'
	R
	'is I was strong.'
	R
	'Strong enough to make money.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'So I continued making money in'
	R
	'kempo matches.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'I used that money to try and'
	R
	'improve this place...'
	R
	'And then...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Next thing I knew, I’d become'
	R
	'one of the demons.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'But...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Whether I got stronger or'
	R
	'became a demon... However much'
	R
	'time passed... I couldn’t cure'
	R
	'greening disease.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'What I can do is continue'
	R
	'bringing money here and kill'
	R
	'any monsters that attack...'
	R
	'That’s it.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_02197:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... Because at least in the'
	R
	'end, I want to be able to say'
	R
	'I was happy...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'I obsess over this place for'
	R
	'myself...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_02223:
	ZH 1:
	'Calory hugged Kite tight.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Calory...?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_02223:
	ZH 1:
	'Calory continued to silently'
	R
	'hug Kite. She clung to him as'
	R
	'hard as she could, like a lost'
	R
	'child.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_02223:
	ZH 1:
	'Kite gently patted Calory on'
	R
	'the head.'
