	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　In Front of the Palace'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'There was a man in front of'
	R
	'the palace and staring at it'
	R
	'without so much as a twitch.'
	R
	'It was Kite.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_02197:
	ZH 1:
	'What... What a palace...'
	R
	'And why is it so thriving...?'
	R
	'It must be thanks to money.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'They cram my sister and Calory'
	R
	'and the others into that place'
	R
	'and only use money to improve'
	R
	'their own lives...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Elsewhere people are suffering'
	R
	'from illness...'
	R
	'Here, it’s like this...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'If you have the money to spend'
	R
	'on this, you could find a way'
	R
	'to cure Calory in no time,'
	R
	'yet... These people...!'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Their pride is disgusting.'
	R
	'These humans are disgusting.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'They need to be purged.'
	R
	'However many humans die, more'
	R
	'will soon be born...'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'For the sake of the new people'
	R
	'that’ll be born, too, it would'
	R
	'be best to clean out the filth'
	R
	'now.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021dd:
	\L_021b3:
	ZH 1:
	'That day, Kite made an arena'
	R
	'at the palace and called it a'
	R
	'public execution site.'
	R
	'To clean out the filth...'
