	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Zeth Palace'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Kite was standing in the'
	R
	'public execution site of an'
	R
	'arena again today.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'He was facing a fat merchant'
	R
	'wearing luxurious clothes.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Hii... Hii...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021b3:
	ZH 1:
	'The merchant was crying while'
	R
	'shivering and pointing a sword'
	R
	'at Kite.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'His whole body was covered'
	R
	'with sweat, tears ran from his'
	R
	'eyes and there was some foam'
	R
	'at the corner of his mouth.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'Kite was forcing him to fight.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'What’s wrong?'
	R
	'Are you done attacking?'
	R
	'I’m still standing.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'P-Please have mercy!'
	R
	'What did I do?!!'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'You lived in luxury.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'You live in luxury and fill'
	R
	'your pockets without caring'
	R
	'for the ill or needy.'
	R
	'This is your punishment.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Th-That’s ridiculous!'
	R
	'Are there not worse people'
	R
	'than me?! Why me?!!'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'People suffering from illness'
	R
	'say the same thing.'
	R
	'The poor die wondering that.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'And those suffering from'
	R
	'incurable illnesses, too...'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'That doesn’t make any sense!'
	R
	'What does this have to do with'
	R
	'me?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'Die.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021eb:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...?'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_021b3:
	ZH 1:
	'Kite held the man’s head in'
	R
	'one hand and squeezed.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'The sound of flesh and bones'
	R
	'being smashed spread through'
	R
	'the area. Blood and brains'
	R
	'flew like it was a ripe fruit.'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_0217b:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_022a0:
	\L_02293:
	\L_02223:
	ZH 1:
	'The people of Zeth that were'
	R
	'commanded to watch did so in'
	R
	'silence.'
	\L_022a0:
	ZH 1:
	'They trembled with awe and the'
	R
	'fear that they could be next'
	R
	'as they did...'
